("h3", "Why is carbon special?"),
("ul", ["**Catenation:** the ability of carbon to join with itself, forming long chains, branched chains and rings.", "**Tetravalency:** four bonds give links with hydrogen, oxygen, nitrogen, sulphur, halogens.", "Strong C&ndash;C bonds make compounds stable."]),
